 "remarks": "Serenely situated on a quiet cul-de-sac, this freestanding single-family condo offers an easy sense of privacy and calm. A welcoming foyer leads into a sunlit living room anchored by a wood-burning fireplace. Outside, a wraparound porch invites you to enjoy the surrounding greenery. Prepare meals in the kitchen and gather in the dining room-or take dinner outdoors to the private backyard and patio. The second floor features three bedrooms, including a primary suite with vaulted ceiling and ensuite bathroom, a second full bath, and laundry for everyday convenience. Below, the finished basement provides an additional 400+ square feet of space for a home gym or office, as well as a half bath and storage. Recent improvements include : New Roof (50 year warranty) - 2025; New Hot Water Heater - 2026; New Heat Pump/AC Condenser/Air Handler for 2nd floor - 2026; New Sliding Glass Door to Patio - 2025; New Front Steps (and newly painted) - 2026; Deck Repainted - 2026",
